{"id":"afd7605d365be7b6","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-consequence.md","title":"Consequence","display":"df-consequence — Consequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-consequence","aliases":["93-df-consequence"],"display":"df-consequence — Consequence","depends_on":["[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-consequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-consequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-consequence — Consequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e30eac382dc7d1a7\" href=\"?note=e30eac382dc7d1a7\" title=\"93-df-set-theoretic-background\">93-df-set-theoretic-background</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cn}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cn}\\)</span> is an operator candidate. Its formula universe is recovered from its domain rather than captured from the ambient context.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conseq}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Conseq}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathrm{Cn}}\">\\(\\vdash_{\\mathrm{Cn}}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consequence}\\vdash\\mathrm{Conseq}_{93}(\\mathrm{Cn})\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists F\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\\mathrm{Cn}:\\mathcal P(F)\\to\\mathcal P(F)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\;(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Gamma))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\Gamma,\\Delta\\subseteq F\\;(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta\\to\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Gamma)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Delta))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\;(\\mathrm{Cn}(\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Gamma))=\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Gamma))\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consequence}\\vdash\\mathrm{Conseq}_{93}(\\mathrm{Cn})\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists F\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\\mathrm{Cn}:\\mathcal P(F)\\to\\mathcal P(F)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\;(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Gamma))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\Gamma,\\Delta\\subseteq F\\;(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta\\to\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Gamma)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Delta))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\;(\\mathrm{Cn}(\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Gamma))=\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Gamma))\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consequence}\\vdash\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathrm{Cn}}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Conseq}_{93}(\\mathrm{Cn})\\land\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{Cn})\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Gamma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consequence}\\vdash\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathrm{Cn}}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Conseq}_{93}(\\mathrm{Cn})\\land\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{Cn})\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Gamma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Extensivity, monotonicity, and idempotence are scoped over the uniquely recoverable carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{Cn})=\\mathcal P(F)\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{Cn})=\\mathcal P(F)\\)</span>. Thus neither predicate silently depends on a book-global formula set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-set-theoretic-background","status":"resolved","id":"e30eac382dc7d1a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-set-theoretic-background]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cn}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conseq}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash_{\\mathrm{Cn}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consequence}\\vdash\\mathrm{Conseq}_{93}(\\mathrm{Cn})\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists F\\;\\Bigl[{}&\\mathrm{Cn}:\\mathcal P(F)\\to\\mathcal P(F)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\;(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Gamma))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\Gamma,\\Delta\\subseteq F\\;(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Delta\\to\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Gamma)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Delta))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\;(\\mathrm{Cn}(\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Gamma))=\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Gamma))\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consequence}\\vdash\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathrm{Cn}}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Conseq}_{93}(\\mathrm{Cn})\\land\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{Cn})\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Cn}(\\Gamma)","display":true},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathrm{Cn})=\\mathcal P(F)","display":false}],"bytes":1404,"backlinks":[{"id":"dc3498f98607795c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"def48430496c026c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5096907e2ea79ebf","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8af8810b5026b75f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a55351eb48f8bd69","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4b52d3210eeab41d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"exc